              "name": "Kitchenista Jane"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great flavor in this very easy to follow simple potato soup. I love the dill mixed with the basil. Very light taste. I did not add the butter, did not think it was necessary, and I added a bit more celery because I love celery - leaves and all. Very tasty for a chilly day meal!"
